 "traps": [
  "the Go module and the npm package share the root folder; the front end sources are in public/ and its Vite config is public/vite.config.js, passed with -c",
  "every front-end package is a devDependency, Vite, Tailwind CSS, htmx and _hyperscript included: they are bundled, not runtime dependencies",
  "docs/ is a separate npm package, opengist-docs, with VitePress, Vue and Tailwind CSS of its own",
  "Bleve is an embedded index inside the Go binary, not a service; Meilisearch is the external alternative chosen by the index key and by the Helm chart's dependency",
  "SQLite is the default (db-uri: opengist.db); PostgreSQL and MySQL are named only in comments of config.yml, by the GORM drivers and, for PostgreSQL, by the Helm chart",
  "the identity providers GitHub, GitLab, Gitea, OpenID Connect and LDAP are configuration keys, used through goth and go-ldap",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
